## Structure

- [`qg.sh`](qg.sh) -- main script.
- [`lib/measure.sh`](lib/measure.sh) -- `count_*` functions and `measure_coverage`.
- [`lib/output.sh`](lib/output.sh) -- text and JSON render.
- [`test-fixtures/baseline/`](test-fixtures/baseline/) -- a clean {{LANGUAGE_NAME}} project.
- [`test-fixtures/regressed/`](test-fixtures/regressed/) -- a project with deliberate regressions in EACH measured metric.

